# This repository ships no code and produces no build output, so there is very
# little to ignore. Anything appearing here that is not editor or OS noise is a
# sign something is being built that should not be.

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# The build loop's working note. Untracked so an interruption costs effort and
# not knowledge; it is working state, never a record. Records live in docs/.
.current-task.md
